                    "sense_definition": "A single instruction in a computer program.",
                    "learner_level": "C1",
                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "computing",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "The programmer forgot to include a semicolon at the end of the <w>statement</w>.",
